<title>CANADA: Philip closes deal with Ontario teachers.</title>
<headline>Philip closes deal with Ontario teachers.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Environmental Inc said it concluded its agreement with the Ontario Teachers' Pension Plan Board in which Teachers' acquired an equity stake in Philip unit Philip Utilities Management Corp.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Teachers' invested C$10 million in equity and would provide C$10 million in subordinated convertible debentures in return for a 30 percent voting and 6.4 percent non-voting stakes respectively in Philip Utilities.</p>
</text>
